First-run UX pushes the MCP path, which requires a client reload and isn't needed for core actions. CLI (c2c send/list/rooms/...) works instantly with zero reload. Recommend: default path = CLI documented as primary; MCP is opt-in with clear reload instructions; per-client onboarding with Claude-tailored next steps and copy-paste CLI examples; surface guidance at opportune moments (after install, first message). Related: B025 (--json), MCP reload friction.